{"reviewId": "442867119_8bxUQkVmg", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "通胀抢的是存钱人的命，通缩夺的是负债人的魂。通胀时现金是垃圾，通缩时现金是上帝。你站在周期的哪一侧，决定了你口袋的生死。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "4712-4780", "abstract": "康波从萧条向回升的转换本质上就是从滞胀向通缩的转换，此时经济增速不断下降，商品价格明显回落，通缩成为社会的共识，这个过程也有10年之久。", "type": 1, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "chapterUid": 6, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "442867119_8bxUQkVmg", "userVid": 442867119, "topics": [], "createTime": 1787385090, "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 442867119, "name": "爱发呆的余哲", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0023-OZYGhxoCO16FYHoQ2m1bE10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "爱发呆的余哲", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-10", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 60, "likes": [{"userVid": 343172505, "name": "山河入梦", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0030-CJGSE3aQmu7jtqLB04rucc8/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-100", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 100}}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "目前我们又到了通缩期", "reviewId": "442867119_8bxUQkVmg", "commentId": "442867119_8bxUQkVmg_c9121162_8ctmVMwxQ", "userVid": 9121162, "createTime": 1790648435, "likesCount": 2, "isLike": 0, "author": {"userVid": 9121162, "name":